er/id #uuid "2afc783b-b9ed-5bd3-afa0-161d31d4cab5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250919} {:answer/id #uuid "5611e50e-f57e-53b9-ad85-570dd238b4dd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251258} {:answer/id #uuid "6848ae3e-4124-5b9d-b387-6eb18ca003db" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2+\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251408} {:answer/id #uuid "748c5c61-72ec-5a32-94cf-d53bf7b85eae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251513}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2afc783b-b9ed-5bd3-afa0-161d31d4cab5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250919} :answer-field/id #uuid "174407a9-f46d-55da-8697-5dbc5ce40bfb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252848}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "6494dcea-ff4c-57dc-b8ab-235d70e87dde" :question/math-academy-id "q-119361" :question/problem "$\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta (\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta })+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta (\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta })+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }}+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =1+({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta ) \\\\  & =1+1 \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that, in the last step, we simplified the right-hand side using ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =1.$ \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta (\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta })+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =2.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186329713 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2f4dfaf9-6adc-58e2-af62-11084821e994" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327358} {:answer/id #uuid "88ee277f-7d39-51d6-ae8e-804455cc5483" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328112} {:answer/id #uuid "9908e0fd-b391-508e-8dd9-9f1b7572eaab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328256} {:answer/id #uuid "b457a22e-59a5-554f-b4d6-d662134d1479" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328503} {:answer/id #uuid "d0528873-0750-5fae-828d-e2dd5c23f87e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328766}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2f4dfaf9-6adc-58e2-af62-11084821e994" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327358} :answer-field/id #uuid "a085cb5f-e013-5736-9ee5-2fef11903a5c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186329453}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "770be8a8-209f-5a4a-8f5b-267370ed95fc" :question/math-academy-id "q-43288" :question/problem "$\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta (\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta })=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta (\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta {cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }}+\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }} \\\\  & ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that, in the last step, we simplified the right-hand side using ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =1.$ \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta (\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta })=1.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186329716 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0efce697-3641-5b14-b027-ecd2b195e7bb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327067} {:answer/id #uuid "24edcb9d-3e64-5b73-8fd1-94c24bf76145" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327254} {:answer/id #uuid "567f1bcb-a850-52d9-9c67-5c37ad657066" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327683} {:answer/id #uuid "5f9f0214-9783-5eb9-916e-a5dd1fa9da94" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327774} {:answer/id #uuid "a00a08ef-de95-5fd8-a811-22199591e5e8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592