, we group the $\\sin^2 \\theta$ and $\\cos^2 \\theta$ terms.\n\n$$\n5\\sin \\theta\\cos \\theta-4\\sin^{2}\\theta+4\\sin \\theta\\cos \\theta-4\\cos^{2}\\theta = 9\\sin \\theta\\cos \\theta-4(\\sin^{2}\\theta+\\cos^{2}\\theta)\n$$\n\nThen, we use $\\sin^2{\\theta}+\\cos^2{\\theta}=1$ to simplify the expression in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n9\\sin \\theta\\cos \\theta-4(\\sin^{2}\\theta+\\cos^{2}\\theta) = 9 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta - 4\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\sin \\theta(5\\cos \\theta-4\\sin \\theta)+\\cos \\theta(4\\sin \\theta-4\\cos \\theta) = 9 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta - 4.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186556256 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "433c8ed3-df62-55d2-abcc-9b9a58ec966b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 6 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta - 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556232} {:answer/id #uuid "73b60723-556b-52c4-8ed2-0a729876c8da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta - 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556246} {:answer/id #uuid "ae2ae507-8108-5fac-951a-af4fc2c7ed68" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 6 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta + 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556267} {:answer/id #uuid "bba30514-e373-50d3-a97c-5a520596fc61" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 6 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556269} {:answer/id #uuid "cb14513e-0a24-5f38-9fea-ecb0a991639c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 5 \\sin^{2} \\theta - 6 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556275}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "433c8ed3-df62-55d2-abcc-9b9a58ec966b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 6 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta - 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556232} :answer-field/id #uuid "24b013c7-1455-5514-a7ea-8c06892d35f3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556218}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "9308f1a0-4615-59cd-aa09-d9f1f8b0336a" :question/problem "Simplify the trigonometric expression $\\sin \\theta(-2\\cos \\theta-5\\sin \\theta)+\\cos \\theta(-4\\sin \\theta-5\\cos \\theta).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\sin \\theta(-2\\cos \\theta-5\\sin \\theta)+\\cos \\theta(-4\\sin \\theta-5\\cos \\theta) = -2\\sin \\theta\\cos \\theta-5\\sin^{2}\\theta-4\\sin \\theta\\cos \\theta-5\\cos^{2}\\theta\n$$\n\nNext, we group the $\\sin^2 \\theta$ and $\\cos^2 \\theta$ terms.\n\n$$\n-2\\sin \\theta\\cos \\theta-5\\sin^{2}\\theta-4\\sin \\theta\\cos \\theta-5\\cos^{2}\\theta = -6\\sin \\theta\\cos \\theta-5(\\sin^{2}\\theta+\\cos^{2}\\theta)\n$$\n\nThen, we use $\\sin^2{\\theta}+\\cos^2{\\theta}=1$ to simplify the expression in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n-6\\sin \\theta\\cos \\theta-5(\\sin^{2}\\theta+\\cos^{2}\\theta) = - 6 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta - 5\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\sin \\theta(-2\\cos \\theta-5\\sin \\theta)+\\cos \\theta(-4\\sin \\theta-5\\cos \\theta) = - 6 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta - 5.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186556259 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01f2a371-b3c2-5453-92d2-b11d63b25731" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta - 5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556210} {:answer/id #uuid "0b4f3740-e5a3-592f-8b95-54c3bc0c9c26" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 8 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556212} {:answer/id #uuid "42f8db48-3a9b-53be-bb71-27277b8ad37c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 5 \\sin^{2} \\theta - 8 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556231} {:answer/id #uuid "d1778c60-1198-5334-a363-0d512711dea3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 8 \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta + 5" :db/id #edb/ref 175921865